<<effects>>
<<if !$xchange.arcology.trouble>><<set $xchange.arcology.trouble to { source: "guest" }>><</if>>
<<run setup.arcology.partySlip("blunder")>>
<<if !$NPCList[2] or !$NPCList[2].cyber>><<arcologyNPC 2 "under" "guest">><</if>>
<<person2>>You follow the <<person>> between the tables and ask your question again. Instead of answering, <<he>> stops beside another guest and speaks quietly into that guest's ear.
<br><br>
<<person3>>The guest is a <<personsimple>> with a black metal jaw. <<arcologyCyberLook 2>> After listening to the first guest's words, <<he>> turns towards you.
<br><br>
"You've had your answer. Go back to your friends. We'll speak downstairs."
