:: Arcology Party Corner
<<effects>>
Two guests wearing matching blue masks leave the dance floor together.
<br><br>
They talk quietly as they walk towards a group of large potted palm trees, then disappear behind them.
<br><br>
<<set $skulduggerydifficulty to 500>>
<<link [[Try to listen|Arcology Party Corner 2]]>><<set $phase to "listen">><</link>><<skulduggerydifficulty>>
<br>
<<link [[Leave them|Arcology Party Corner 2]]>><<set $phase to "leave">><</link>>
